<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction two bln skr in 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction two bln skr in 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Tuesday for an auction of two billion crowns of 10-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1030 GMT on May 21.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1037</p>
<p>Auction date			     May 21</p>
<p>Maturity date			    August 15, 2007</p>
<p>Coupon  (pct)			    8.0</p>
<p>Amount to the market (billions)    2.0</p>
<p>Settlement date			  May 26, 1997</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
